t spells<else><if ($n4 == 14)>heat waves<else><if ($n4 == 22)>storm clouds<else><if ($n4 == 23)>rough seas<else><if ($n4 == 24)>rough seas<else><if ($n4 == 26)>heat waves<else><if ($n4 == 2)>fair skies<else><if ($n4 == 49)>umbral wind<else><if ($n4 == 50)>umbral static<else><if ($n4 == 148)>moon dust<else><if ($n4 == 149)>astromagnetic storms<else><if ($n4 == 190)>atmospheric phantasms<else><if ($n4 == 191)>illusory disturbances<else><if ($n4 == 192)>auroral mirages<else><sheet Weather $n4 1></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></lower-first></if></if>. Tomorrow at this time, the area should <if ($n4 == $n5)>still be <sheet Weather $n5 2><else>be <sheet Weather $n5 2></if>."
